# 10-env.zsh — deliberately empty.
#
# The original ~/.zshrc never set EDITOR, VISUAL, PAGER, LESS, MANPAGER,
# MANWIDTH, LANG, or any XDG variable. oh-my-zsh and the tools' own defaults
# decide those. Setting them here would change behaviour, so nothing is set.
#
# If you want them, this is the place — but it should be your decision, not
# a hidden default from this repo.
